  "details": "Many avatars that were previously pc+quest supported are reverting to pc only or quest only, including some of my own. People on quest run quest-only avatars that were previously hybrid and and people on pc now run pc-only avatars. Which avatars are visible to both and invisible to both varies on the player. Switching in and out of the avatar seems to fix the issue.",
